{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> at the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/b/4ab12283d82be19a7f4fc3886c17c4dd0c16482b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{8}{x^2+4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"85\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54abe49c29fdbf920d53d4890237037c2625a8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/2/3222c84bc3e7abfc9f11ba426c2ff38f9678bb87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2+\\sqrt{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -2-\\sqrt{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"572\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Isolating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in the second equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/e/24e2eaa04b1303848426b7ec84cfdd3941236a7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />.  Substituting for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in the first equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75ebb4d9283d9cf44690362b27c48fa7a5ff9677.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-x=\\frac{8}{x^2+4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" />, which can be rearranged to form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2acd06c53d97c1f0b3b8095c90ef56234bfe6221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x^2-2x+4)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"21\" />.  The only value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying this equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2f8d2c21f0651d673108bab3b1ac2cbdbf302af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"91\" height=\"30\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/0/b90726eda864dfbaf505366faaecfd69f3e2a603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> has no real roots.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><